program	errors/place_window_beside_var_root.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	differs
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: the place `p.at(…)` borrows `p` for the whole window, and `p` is accessed by reference a second time in the same call
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: exclusive access violation: the place `p.at(…)` borrows `p` for the whole window, and `p` is accessed by reference a second time in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/errors/place_window_beside_var_root.saw:45:10"
log	"     |"
log	" 45 |     sink(&var p.at(0), reset(&var p))"
log	"     |          ^"
log	"   hint: a place borrow charges its ROOT, so two windows onto one receiver — or a window beside a `&var` of it — cannot both be open. Open them in SEPARATE statements, or reach for the method that does both at once (`v.swap(i, j)`)"
log	""
log	"error: exclusive access violation: the place `p.at(…)` borrows `p` for the whole window, and `p` is accessed by reference a second time in the same call"
